{"title":"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Without_Finding_Exact_Value)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Without Finding Exact Value)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the integer equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b0467cf87e4846a0158bb8e64b88cab9b8fe963e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{20} - 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />. What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601d380de96fc6ba7f0012d0d13274b9faa71d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{20} - 20 = 99~999~999~999~999~999~980$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"314\" height=\"18\" />. Counting the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, we see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> of them, and there is one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of the digits is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4edc9517bdd11d76a793ea33d32497a628a2c76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 18 + 8 \\times 1 + 0 \\times 1 = 162 + 8 + 0 = \\boxed{170}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"354\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Without_Finding_Exact_Value.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Without_Finding_Exact_Value)\">Solution 2 (Without Finding Exact Value)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Without Finding Exact Value)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that if we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3923395d6aeeb81fb65a1997b9f1b3ab15fb8efb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{k} - 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" /> for some integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the number would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be00435729953d84bb182435ff88770517207b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s followed by an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. For instance, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335f20c7ab08ff4f3cd6506f75fce94f910c07a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{3} - 20 = 1000 - 20 = 980$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce477a82eea926a5190f4c97f71f46c1316acbe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> followed by an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b0467cf87e4846a0158bb8e64b88cab9b8fe963e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{20} - 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d5ca5642136b9db04f31fb5a7ae4ad3ccd1685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 - 2 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> doesn't add to the sum of the digits, so the sum of the digits is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b919012b6a78f044a3b3590050c6a3c23cdc158.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 18 + 8 \\times 1 = 162 + 8 = \\boxed{170}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"260\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 115/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5025/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.341      1 2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    6.341      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37040:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001947 and revision id 286177. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}